{
  "slug": "searchfit",
  "name": "Searchfit",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Free AI-powered SEO toolkit — audit websites, plan content strategy, optimize pages, generate schema markup, cluster keywords, and track AI visibility. Includes 11 skills, 3 autonomous agents, and 6 slash commands. Works with any website or codebase.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **11 skills**, **3 agents** and **6 commands**.\n\n- **Skills** (11): `ai-visibility` (Analyze and improve how a brand appears in AI-generated responses (ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini, Perplexity)), `broken-links` (Find and fix broken links on a website or in a codebase), `content-brief` (Generate a detailed content brief for a specific article or page), `content-strategy` (Develop a content strategy for SEO and organic growth), `content-translation` (Translate and localize website content for international SEO), `internal-linking` (Analyze and improve internal linking strategy for a website), `keyword-clustering` (Cluster and organize keywords into topical groups for SEO), `on-page-seo` (Optimize a specific page for on-page SEO), and 3 more\n- **Agents** (3): `competitor-analyzer`, `content-strategist`, `seo-auditor`\n- **Commands** (6): `create-content` (Generate SEO-optimized content for a specific topic or keyword), `create-topic` (Research and generate a complete topic plan with keyword mapping, content angle, audience targeting, and competitive positioning), `generate-schema` (Generate JSON-LD structured data / schema markup for a page), `keyword-cluster` (Cluster a list of keywords into topical groups mapped to content pages), `seo-check` (Quick SEO check on the current file or page), `translate-content` (Translate and localize content for international SEO)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install searchfit@claude-community` from `searchfit/searchfit-seo`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
